85
00:10:56.864 --> 00:11:00.766
Uh, do you know who I am?

86
00:11:01.168 --> 00:11:02.499
What?

87
00:11:03.404 --> 00:11:06.840
I don't know who I am.

88
00:11:08.208 --> 00:11:09.675
